Cell["\<\
Returns KroneckerProduct[hoppingMatrix, modulationBlock] + \
KroneckerProduct[identityMatrix, additiveBlock].\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->299637043,ExpressionUUID->"a06108ad-3583-0342-8da2-4f1b9636e994"],

Cell["\<\
The internal degrees of freedom form the outer tensor factor and photon \
sectors form the inner factor. The input factors are typically obtained from \
PhotonBlocks or NPhotonBlocks.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2067321753,ExpressionUUID->"ae88395b-9189-044d-a7b8-338ea567cfe4"]
}, Closed]],

